          "content": "| Fig. No. | Number of square | Pattern |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 8 | 3<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup> |\n| 2 | 12 | 4<sup>2</sup> - 2<sup>2</sup> |\n| 3 | 16 | 5<sup>2</sup> - 3<sup>2</sup> |\n| . | . | . |\n| . | . | . |\n| . | . | . |\n| . |  |  |",
