        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.378,
            0.815,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": "How many are there in Step 4 of the sequence? What about Step 10?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.411,
            0.569,
            0.432
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Step 4 → Number of squares $6^{2} - 4^{2}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.443,
            0.558,
            0.465
          ],
          "content": "Step 10 → Number of squares → $12^{2} = 10^{2}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.481,
            0.846,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": "？ Write an algebraic expression for the number of tiles in Step n. Share your methods with the class. Can you find more than one method to arrive at the answer?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.549,
            0.315,
            0.569
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** $( n + 2 ) ^ { 2 } - n ^ { 2 }$"
        },
